meta {
  name: Submit inbox message
  type: http
  seq: 12
}

post {
  url: {{offersBaseUrl}}/api/inbox
  body: json
  auth: none
}

body:json {
  {
    "routing_key": "ImportOfferDetails",
    "source": "bruno",
    "payload": {
      "retailer_code": "AnkerAu",
      "title": "USB charger",
      "price": { "amount": 1999, "currency": "AUD" },
      "url": "{{offerUrl}}"
    }
  }
}

docs {
  Stores one message and returns 202 with its message_id. No queue is processed.
  Send Run inbox, Run commands, then Run events to populate the read models.
  The command payload uses enum name AnkerAu, unlike the direct import slug ankerau.
  payload is required and must be nonempty; null, blank strings, [] and {} are rejected.
  routing_key and source must contain non-whitespace text. Unknown command types are accepted.
  Optional message_id and correlation_id must be UUID strings.
  Omit message_id for a new UUID. Reusing it succeeds and preserves the original row.
  Invalid envelopes return 400; storage or blocking-task failures return 500.
}
